### Loading screen

Both season and weather changes use the **shared `ViewTransitionOverlay`** — the same fade-in/fade-out mechanism used by seat teleportation, POI teleport, and view switches.

Season changes use a Kit-dispatched `seasonChangeCompleted` event to trigger fade-in (after `_SETTLE_FRAMES`). Weather changes use a frontend-only 500ms `setTimeout` → `notifyViewTransitionKitReady()` since the preset application is synchronous.

Localized labels:

| Language | `loading.changingSeason` | `loading.changingWeather` |
|----------|--------------------------|---------------------------|
| English | Changing season… | Changing weather… |
| Swedish | Byter årstid… | Byter väder… |
| French | Changement de saison… | Changement de météo… |
| Spanish | Cambiando de estación… | Cambiando el clima… |

